{{- /* Rendered by Vault Agent (see vault-agent.hcl) into a real config file at runtime.
       This .ctmpl file is safe to commit — it contains no secret material, only the
       lookup instruction. The rendered output (newrelic-infra.ini) never is. */ -}}
